    "created_at": "2022-10-01T14:17:36Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-10-01T14:17:36Z",
    "body": "> @bokand why is this in the compat spec?\r\n\r\nI think there was a preference to put it in Compat since the viewport meta spec text doesn't really exist yet in CSS-Viewport so I got advice to put it in Compat for the time being instead.\r\n\r\nI did [ask about](https://groups.google.com/a/chromium.org/g/blink-dev/c/ge7xTu-VhJ0/m/KIZWul6IAwAJ) just putting it into CSS-Viewport - if you're good with it I'm happy to move this PR to there. (though according to Rune the existing spec text for meta viewport parsing needs to be rewritten anyway).",
    "author_association": "NONE",
